      "name": "Product Detail Card",
      "role": "E-commerce product showcase",
      "description": "White surface, 90px radius, heavy rgba(0,0,0,0.3) shadow at 15/20/30 offset/spread. Image at top fills with bleed, then ~30px padding, Unica77 700 price at 35–47px, Unica77 400 product name at 21–25px, small-caps Whyte Semi-Mono category tag at 12–17px."
