      "name": "Dark Section Panel",
      "role": "Inverted content block",
      "description": "#121212 background, 90px outer radius on the cards inside. White (#ffffff) text, Whyte Semi-Mono labels in #bcc1c7, headings in Unica77 600. Internal dark cards lift to #1e1e1e."
